EmitSeqModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Dispatcher lowering a node sequence into IR blocks; recursively invokes branch/loop submodules.
    Provides: EmitSeq(nodes, tail, blocks, openIdx, counter) -> out.
    DependsOn: EmitInstruction, EmitBranch, EmitLoop, EmitTail, LowerInstr, NewOpen, FindChild (via Include)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../EmitSeq/EmitSeq.sir).
